  "translation": "Yehoasha (Yehoasha), Isirayel ka masakɛ, y'a ci Amasiya (Amasiya), Yuda ka masakɛ ma, ko: kɔgɔjɛ min bɛ Lebanɔn, o ye ci jiri bon min bɛ Lebanɔn ma, ko: i denmuso di ⟨את⟩ ne denkɛ ma k'a kɛ a muso ye; ka bagan min bɛ Lebanɔn tɛmɛ, o ye tuji ⟨את⟩ kɔgɔjɛ.",
